---
title: Lab — Ross Breadmore
layout: home.njk
---

<div class="page-intro">
  <h2 class="page-intro-title">Lab</h2>
  <p class="page-intro-sub">Working in the open. Ideas in various states — active, exploring, stalled, shipped.</p>
</div>

<ol class="lab-list">
  {% for item in lab %}
  <li class="lab-item">
    <div class="lab-item-header">
      <span class="lab-status lab-status--{{ item.status }}">{{ item.status }}</span>
    </div>
    {% if item.slug %}
      <h3 class="lab-title"><a href="{{ item.slug }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h3>
    {% else %}
      <h3 class="lab-title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="lab-description">{{ item.description }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
